<title>POLAND: PEKPOL REVISES DOWN 1996 OPERATING.</title>
<headline>PEKPOL REVISES DOWN 1996 OPERATING.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-04-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Pekpol preliminary results for</p>
<p>the financial year ending December 31, 1996.</p>
<p>(Figures in millions of zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p>						   1996	 1995</p>
<p>    operating loss			   0.76 vs    1.34 profit</p>
<p>    pre-tax profit			   2.66 vs    3.25</p>
<p>    net profit				 1.58 vs    2.56</p>
<p>    net sales				197.46 vs  172.19</p>
<p>    costs of sales			 176.75 vs  154.33</p>
<p>    extraordinary loss		     0.02 vs    0.03 profit</p>
<p>    income tax				 1.08 vs    0.70</p>
<p>    other taxes				0.00 vs    0.00</p>
<p>    financial revenues		     6.28 vs    4.04</p>
<p>    financial costs			  3.46 vs    2.62</p>
<p>    investment				 7.73 vs    2.17</p>
<p>NOTE: Full company name is Pekpol SA. Earlier the company said</p>
<p>its operating loss for 1996 was 0.5 million zlotys.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
